<title>POLAND: All Polish minimum T-bill prices flat at tender.</title>
<headline>All Polish minimum T-bill prices flat at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills were flat at today's primary auction on total demand of 281 million zlotys against a 400 million zloty offer, the finance ministry said.  </p>
<p>    T-bill	   8-week  13-week  26-week  39-week  52-week</p>
<p>   new min price     --     95.46    91.12     --	83.47</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)     --    (95.46)  (91.12)    --     (83.47)</p>
<p>   new max price     --     95.52    91.17     --	83.50</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)     --    (95.50)  (91.16)    --     (83.50)</p>
<p>   offer		 --     100.0    100.0     --	200.0</p>
<p>   bids recorded     --	75.9     68.0     --	137.1</p>
<p>   bids accepted     --	50.8     30.0     --	 54.8</p>
<p>   next auction	--     200.0    300.0     --	400.0</p>
<p>NOTE. Offer and all bids in million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
